; Main Parameters
G21 ; (Set Units to Millimeters)

; Printhead begining possition
;G28	; (Move to Origin - Home)
G90 
G1 Z10 F3000 ; save Z height
G1 Y100 F3000 ; (avoid light collision)
G1 X23 F3000; (nozzle left back corner)
G1 Z20 
PAUSE ; clean the nozzle to remove all the visible solution - then write 'restart' 



; Set values
G1 Z1.5 ; NTCD (mm)

PAUSE ; whait the jet top be generated - write 'restart' to continue the print


G1 F2000 ; set feedrate (mm/min)
G91 ; relative positioning

